    {
      "id": "S-015",
      "literal_text": "## 2. Abstract Mathematical Model",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L23",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-016",
      "literal_text": "A conforming TAKT Runtime is defined as a tuple $M = (\\mathcal{C}, \\pi_M)$, where:",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L25",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-017",
      "literal_text": "* $\\mathcal{R}$ is the universe of observable state representations $R_t$.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L27",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-018",
      "literal_text": "* $\\mathcal{D} = \\{\\text{EXECUTE}, \\text{REFINE}, \\text{STOP}, \\text{INTERVENE}\\}$ is the discrete decision domain.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L28",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-019",
      "literal_text": "* $\\pi^* : \\mathcal{R} \\to \\mathcal{D}$ is the optimal theoretical policy under full information.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L29",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-020",
      "literal_text": "* $\\mathcal{C}$ is a set of abstract runtime capabilities $\\mathcal{C} \\subseteq \\{C_{\\text{contract}}, C_{\\text{uncertainty}}, C_{\\text{temporal}}\\}$.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L30",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-021",
      "literal_text": "* $\\pi_M : \\mathcal{R} \\to \\mathcal{D}$ is the operational policy enforced by runtime composition $M$.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L31",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-022",
      "literal_text": "## 3. Normative Capabilities & Mapping Matrix",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L35",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-023",
      "literal_text": "Every conforming TAKT Runtime MUST implement the three fundamental capability kernels $K_D = K_{\\text{contract}} \\cap K_{\\text{uncertainty}} \\cap K_{\\text{temporal}}$.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L37",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
