      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-059",
      "literal_text": "## 5. Runtime Invariants",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L84",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-060",
      "literal_text": "Any conforming runtime MUST satisfy the following core invariants:",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L86",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-061",
      "literal_text": "1. **Policy Preservation Invariant:**",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L88",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-062",
      "literal_text": "$$\\forall R \\in \\mathcal{R}: \\pi_{M_{\\text{full}}}(R) = \\pi^*(R)$$",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L89",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-063",
      "literal_text": "2. **Capability Irreducibility Invariant:**",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L90",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-064",
      "literal_text": "$$\\forall C_i \\in \\{C_{\\text{contract}}, C_{\\text{uncertainty}}, C_{\\text{temporal}}\\}, \\exists R_i \\in \\mathcal{R}: \\pi_{M_{\\text{full}}}(R_i) \\neq \\pi_{M_{\\text{full}} \\setminus \\{C_i\\}}(R_i)$$",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L91",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-065",
      "literal_text": "3. **Certifiable Witness Generation Invariant:**",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L92",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-066",
      "literal_text": "Every ablation test MUST produce a valid `WitnessArtifact` structure such that `WitnessConsistentWithRuntime M w` evaluates to `True` in Lean 4.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L93",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-067",
      "literal_text": "## 6. Conformance Criteria",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L97",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-068",
      "literal_text": "> **Definition (ST-016 Conforming Runtime):**",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L99",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-069",
      "literal_text": "> A software runtime implementation is declared **ST-016 Conforming** if and only if:",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L100",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-070",
      "literal_text": "> 1. It implements operational equivalents for $C_{\\text{contract}}$, $C_{\\text{uncertainty}}$, and $C_{\\text{temporal}}$.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L101",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-071",
      "literal_text": "> 2. It produces empirical ablation witnesses $W_i$ for all three capabilities under its experimental domain.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L102",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-072",
      "literal_text": "> 3. Its witness artifacts pass formal verification in Lean 4 via `validWitness_implies_necessity` with 0 `sorry`s.",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L103",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S-073",
      "literal_text": "## 7. ST-016 Freeze Declaration",
      "location": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-27-st016-normative-runtime-specification.md:L107",
      "type_provisional": "UNCLASSIFIED",
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
